// fixture-400: registry-protocol §5.2 NORMATIVE yank clause — a new
// resolution MUST exclude the yanked 2.0.0 and select the highest
// non-yanked candidate (1.0.0), even though 2.0.0 is newer and would
// otherwise win under maxver strategy.  Deliberately no mocked-fetches
// entry exists for v2.0.0 — if an impl regresses and still considers the
// yanked version, resolution fails with FETCH-MOCK-MISSING instead of
// silently reproducing the old (pre-A5) behavior.
name "myapp"
kind "application"
deps {
    bar
}
